    "description": "China\u2019s new duty-free regime for Africa: Implications for Global Trade and Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/chinas-new-duty-free-regime-for-africa-implications-for-global-trade-and-sri-lanka/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
