    "chunk_size_bytes": 1040,
    "chunk_text": "A highlight of the evening was the felicitation of former Sri Lankan Ambassador to Russia Dr. Saman Weerasinghe in recognition of his contribution to enhancing bilateral relations. In his address, Dr. Weerasinghe reflected on his longstanding association with Russia and expressed gratitude for the support extended by the Russian Government and people throughout his career.\n\nThe evening concluded on a high note with networking and fellowship, reaffirming the SLRBC\u2019s role as a key platform for promoting trade, investment, and cooperation between Sri Lanka and the Russian Federation.\n\nRussian Ambassador Levan S. Dzhagaryan (centre), together with SLRBC President Chamath Hettiarachchi, presenting a token of appreciation to Dr. Saman Weerasinghe in recognition of his contributions to strengthening Sri Lanka-Russia relations\n\nSLRBC President Chamath Hettiarachchi (left) presenting a token of appreciation to Russian Ambassador Levan S. Dzhagaryan in recognition of his valuable support in strengthening Sri Lanka\u2013Russia relations"
  },
  {
