    "md5": "c915320cd2bd4104f6dc6b8e1ad0978a",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1975,
    "chunk_text": "Vogue Jewellers achieves double recognition at BMPC Awards 2026\n\nVogue Jewellers Ltd. has been honoured with two prestigious accolades at the Best Management Practices Company (BMPC) Awards 2026, organised by the Institute of Chartered Professional Managers of Sri Lanka (CPM Sri Lanka).\n\nThe company received a Merit Award in the highly competitive People/HR Governance (ESG) category and was named Winner in the Manufacturing Sector (Diamonds, Gems and Jewellery) for the second consecutive year, in recognition of Vogue Jewellers\u2019 commitment to operational excellence, ethical governance and sustainable business practices.\n\nThe Merit Award in People/HR Governance (ESG) highlights the company\u2019s robust human resource frameworks, inclusive workplace culture and alignment with Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) principles. Through targeted initiatives focused on employee development, ethical practices and responsible people strategies, Vogue Jewellers has strengthened its organisational foundation, fostering a performance-driven yet caring environment that values diversity, equity and long-term talent growth.\n\nSimultaneously, the repeat win in the Manufacturing Sector (Diamonds, Gems and Jewellery) category reaffirms Vogue Jewellers\u2019 leadership position in an intensely competitive industry. This back-to-back success reflects the company\u2019s consistent delivery of innovation, superior quality standards and operational efficiency, while upholding the highest levels of craftsmanship and integrity that have defined its legacy.\n\n\u201cThese achievements are a proud reflection of the collective dedication and hard work of our entire team,\u201d said Managing Director Anura Hemachandra. \u201cOur employees\u2019 commitment to excellence has been a significant driving force behind our success. We remain firmly dedicated to continuous improvement, investing in people development and upholding the highest standards across every aspect of our operations.\u201d"
  },
