    "description": "WAMY contributes $ 26,000 to \u2018Rebuilding Sri Lanka\u2019 Program",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/WAMY-contributes-26-000-to-Rebuilding-Sri-Lanka-Program/56-790621",
