    "description": "Cabinet approves Rs. 5 m housing scheme for estate workers hit by Cyclone Ditwah",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Cabinet-approves-Rs-5-m-housing-scheme-for-estate-workers-hit-by-Cyclone-Ditwah/56-790622",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
