    "chunk_text": "Altair elevates living experience with appointment of RMS as Facilities Management Partner\n\nThe Management Council of Altair, Colombo\u2019s most iconic residential and mixed-use development, has appointed Realty Management Services Ltd (RMS) as its new facilities management partner, marking a significant step forward in enhancing operational excellence and the overall resident experience. RMS is a subsidiary of Overseas Realty Ceylon PLC, the owning company of the World Trade Centre and Havelock City.\n\nThis transition reflects a renewed commitment to delivering consistent, professional, and responsive property management aligned with Altair\u2019s premium positioning.\n\nRMS brings over 28 years of industry experience in managing high-rise and luxury residential and commercial developments, underpinned by a financially sound parent company, and a strong foundation in engineering, compliance, and operational governance. The company is recognized for its professional approach to facilities management, having secured several new facilities management contracts at high-end residential apartments.\n\nResidents can expect visible enhancements in day-to-day living, including improved response times, elevated housekeeping standards, strengthened security protocols, and more structured and transparent communication channels. These improvements will be driven through clearly defined service levels, a dedicated on-site management team, and robust performance monitoring practices.\n\nTechnology integration will further enhance the resident experience, with plans to introduce digital service platforms, streamlined reporting mechanisms, and data-informed maintenance planning. Sustainability-driven initiatives and energy optimization strategies will also be progressively introduced to improve efficiency and reduce operational costs over time."
