    "description": "18-year-old French student of Lankan origin Bilaal Lookman elected to city council",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/18-year-old-French-student-of-Lankan-origin-Bilaal-Lookman-elected-to-city-council/56-790647",
    "lang": "en",
