    "md5": "e17c1c148e58f5f220c2c1cca3a03f64",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1838,
    "chunk_text": "Sri Lankans must honour Colombo Archbishop for his Easter Vigil speech\n\nSri Lankans must honour Colombo Archbishop Cardinal Malcolm Ranjith for \u2018hitting the nail right on its head\u2019 over the Israeli-American war on Iran. The respected Archbishop declared that the entire humanity is undergoing pain and suffering due to the greed of one man wanting to rule the whole world. Adolf Hitler tried to become \u2018Emperor of Europe\u2019. What was his fate?, queried the Archbishop delivering the sermon at the midnight Easter Vigil Service at the St Lucia\u2019s Cathedral, Kotahena in Colombo.\n\nThe leader of Sri Lanka\u2019s minority Catholic community spoke out defiantly against the leader of the world\u2019s most powerful nation, \u2018who is showering bombs destroying neigbours\u2019 and said this leader cannot be called Christian, because Christians love their neighbours and will not do what this man is currently doing, in an obvious reference to US President Donald Trump.\n\nThe Cardinal\u2019s sermon has greater relevance in the backdrop of the temporary two weeks pause reportedly agreed on late 7 April night between the US and Iran to facilitate Pakistan-led talks, amidst fears that Donald Trump, describe by US Senator Bernie Sanders on Monday as \u2018dangerous and mentally unbalanced\u2019, may torpedo within days this much awaited break to end the reckless war through meaningful dialogue.\n\nThe Archbishop\u2019s sermon has added significance in the context of the shocking silence of other religious, civil society, and business leaders in the country, including Pathfinders, Am-Chambers, Center for Policy Alternatives etc., even while every human being in the planet is disproportionately made to pay for an unprovoked and illegal war unleashed by the Israelis and the Americans directly on Iran but virtually on every living thing in the world."
