    "chunk_text": "Train service  on Northern line resumes\n\nTrain services on the Northern Railway Line resumed yesterday following an India-supported restoration project of cyclone-damaged sections affected by Cyclone Ditwah. The project was under a $ 5 million grant as part of India\u2019s $ 450 million package. Completed ahead of the Sinhala and Tamil New Year, it restores a vital connectivity link across affected regions."
