    "description": "Notifiable data breaches:  How banks, regulators  and Central Bank all forgot to catch the ball",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Notifiable-data-breaches-How-banks-regulators-and-Central-Bank-all-forgot-to-catch-the-ball/4-790724",
    "lang": "en",
