    "chunk_text": "On a wider front however, whether Iran\u2019s enemies choose peace or war the world is in for another period of stagflation and low economic growth. The oil-backed dollar economy of the US is facing a historic crisis and Israel, according to an insider, is \u201ccracking\u201d from within, and so is Trump\u2019s MAGA political movement. According to independent observers, the war is now moving beyond the region and may change the global power dynamics to put an end to the post-World War II International Order. In a latest move, the UK is sending troops to the Middle East to defend its interests, after Iran fired missiles on Cyprus. It is a significant development, after Trump\u2019s criticism of NATO allies. In the meantime, China is gleefully watching from the sideline to see whether that change would finally transfer global leadership from the North to South.\n\nOn the contrary, Iran never threatened any of these regimes either militarily or otherwise until now.\u00a0 Iran\u2019s uranium enrichment program and its potential for developing a nuclear arsenal are a legitimate response to Israel, which already has those weapons, and is aiming to destroy Iran with the US assistance to clear the way for Greater Israel, to emerge as the superpower in the Middle East."
