    "chunk_text": "SLIA award for Sri Lanka\u2019s first Three Sinha Clean Room Door, turning a new page in healthcare and laboratory sectors\n\nThree Sinha Industries Ltd. Managing Director Manjula Ariyakumara (left) receiving the award\n\nThree Sinha Industries Ltd. has been honoured with the Product Award of Merit at the Sri Lanka Institute of Architects (SLIA) Annual Sessions 2026, recognising the company\u2019s excellence in locally manufactured construction products. The award was presented under the category of \u201cLocally Made Products and Materials using Local and Imported Materials and Equipment\u201d for the company\u2019s innovative Clean Room Door solution. This recognition highlights Three Sinha Industries\u2019 commitment to quality manufacturing, technical precision, and contribution to Sri Lanka\u2019s architectural and construction sectors. The SLIA Product Awards are regarded as one of the most prestigious recognitions in the built environment industry, celebrating innovation, sustainability, and excellence in materials and product development. Receiving this award places Three Sinha Industries among a select group of manufacturers that meet the highest standards of performance and design."
